      ""
      "\"what the fuck.\" they said as"
      "they witnessed a child slit"
      "the throat of a merchant."
      "]],[[\"why do you savage your "
      "countrymen, gentle sinner?\""
      "the god inquired. \"is this"
      "the life you choose to lead?"
