      "remains\" the sinner remarked."
      ""
      "the god laughed. \"ah, how"
      "true. unlike my flowers, you"
      "need more than the sun and"
      "the winds and the rain.\""
      "]],[[\"but\" the god continued \"you "
      "have many options a flower"
      "sorely lacks. why not take up"
      "a job? perhaps philosophy?\""
      ""
      "the sinner gestured to "
