      "esteem by the community."
      "nobody would offer me a job."
      "i would be laughed away from"
      "even philosophy, the most"
      "effortless of professions.\""
      ""
      "the god frowned. \"a shame, to"
      "be sure. destitution seems"
      "rather hard to leave behind.\""
      "]],[[\"but\" the god continued \"you"
      "have yet one option - prayer!"
      "why not ask of aid from "
