      "hand to the sinner \"i may be"
      "blind to the problems of this"
      "world, but you are not. join "
      "me, oh gentle sinner, and we "
      "will rectify it together.\""
      "]],[[the child looked at the god's"
      "hand with doubt."
      "\"i will admit i find this"
