      "the divine. is a kitten"
      "vicious for hurting a mouse?\""
      ""
      "the gentle sinner took hold"
      "of the hand of god."
      "]],[[together, the god and their"
      "pet sinner made many changes"
      "to the world. "
      ""
      "poverty was abolished. food"
      "became widely availible."
      "education was accessible to"
      "all, and humanity entered an"
